title: "frads-gym: A Gymnasium environment for facade control with EnergyPlus and Radiance"
version: 0.2.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.18504304
url: "https://github.com/silaskalmbach/frads-gym"
repository-code: "https://github.com/silaskalmbach/frads-gym"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - building-simulation
  - energyplus
  - radiance
  - gymnasium
  - facade-control
  - daylight-simulation
abstract: "A Gymnasium environment that couples EnergyPlus (thermal and energy simulation) and Radiance (daylight and glare) through frads for controlling switchable facades, such as electrochromic glazing, with reinforcement learning. The agent sets the glazing state at every EnergyPlus timestep; observations such as work-plane illuminance, glare probability and energy use are declared in a JSON configuration."
